# The carrier of a road waits next to the flag at its far end and is drawn there, as the original's tile pass draws it.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh carrier-waits --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --fps 10
# On that map the castle stands at 21,4, so its flag is at 22,5. The woodcutter goes to 26,4, its flag to 27,5.
expect seed = 1234567812345678
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 21 4
wait 0.3
button Woodcutter
click-tile 26 4
button Woodcutter
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 22 5
click-tile 23 5
click-tile 24 5
click-tile 25 5
click-tile 26 5
click-tile 27 5
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward carrier state 0x42 max 20000
wait 0.3
expect-at 26 5 carrier
wait 0.3
shot waits 25 5 2 4
